<quiz>
  <question type="stack">
    <name>
      <text>Excircle radii of a right triangle (INNODEMS)</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>The right-angled triangle below (right angle at \(C\)) has sides
\(a = {@sa@}\) cm, \(b = {@sb@}\) cm and \(c = {@sc@}\) cm.</p>

<p>Each side has an <em>excircle</em>: a circle lying <em>outside</em> the triangle that
is tangent to that side and to the extensions of the other two sides. The three excircles
\(J_a, J_b, J_c\) are drawn in blue. Find the radius of each one, in centimetres.</p>

[[jsxgraph width='480px' height='430px']]
var la = {#sa#};            // side a = BC (opposite A), drawn horizontal
var lb = {#sb#};            // side b = CA (opposite B), drawn vertical
var lc = Math.sqrt(la*la + lb*lb);
var Ax = 0, Ay = lb, Bx = la, By = 0, Cx = 0, Cy = 0;   // right angle at C
function exc(wA, wB, wC) {   // excentre = weighted vertex average, opp side negated
  var d = wA + wB + wC;
  return [(wA*Ax + wB*Bx + wC*Cx)/d, (wA*Ay + wB*By + wC*Cy)/d];
}
var JA = exc(-la, lb, lc), JB = exc(la, -lb, lc), JC = exc(la, lb, -lc);
var rA = Math.abs(JA[1]), rB = Math.abs(JB[0]);
var rC = Math.abs((Bx-Ax)*(Ay-JC[1]) - (Ax-JC[0])*(By-Ay)) / lc;
var xs = [Cx,Bx,Ax,JA[0]-rA,JA[0]+rA,JB[0]-rB,JB[0]+rB,JC[0]-rC,JC[0]+rC];
var ys = [Cy,By,Ay,JA[1]-rA,JA[1]+rA,JB[1]-rB,JB[1]+rB,JC[1]-rC,JC[1]+rC];
var xmin = Math.min.apply(null,xs), xmax = Math.max.apply(null,xs);
var ymin = Math.min.apply(null,ys), ymax = Math.max.apply(null,ys);
var pX = 0.1*(xmax-xmin), pY = 0.1*(ymax-ymin);
var board = JXG.JSXGraph.initBoard(divid, {boundingbox:[xmin-pX, ymax+pY, xmax+pX, ymin-pY],
  keepaspectratio:true, axis:false, showCopyright:false, showNavigation:false,
  pan:{enabled:false}, zoom:{enabled:false}});
var A = board.create('point',[Ax,Ay],{fixed:true,highlight:false,name:'A',size:2,label:{offset:[-12,4]}});
var B = board.create('point',[Bx,By],{fixed:true,highlight:false,name:'B',size:2,label:{offset:[10,-8]}});
var C = board.create('point',[Cx,Cy],{fixed:true,highlight:false,name:'C',size:2,label:{offset:[-12,-10]}});
board.create('polygon',[A,B,C],{fixed:true,highlight:false,fillOpacity:0,
  borders:{strokeColor:'#222',strokeWidth:2,highlight:false,fixed:true},vertices:{visible:false}});
board.create('angle',[A,C,B],{type:'square',radius:Math.min(la,lb)*0.18,fixed:true,highlight:false});
var ext = {straightFirst:true,straightLast:true,dash:2,strokeColor:'#999',strokeWidth:1,fixed:true,highlight:false};
board.create('line',[B,C],ext); board.create('line',[C,A],ext); board.create('line',[A,B],ext);
var co = {strokeColor:'#1565c0',strokeWidth:1.5,fillColor:'none',fixed:true,highlight:false};
board.create('circle',[JA,rA],co); board.create('circle',[JB,rB],co); board.create('circle',[JC,rC],co);
board.create('point',JA,{fixed:true,highlight:false,name:'J_a',size:1,strokeColor:'#1565c0',fillColor:'#1565c0',label:{offset:[-6,-10]}});
board.create('point',JB,{fixed:true,highlight:false,name:'J_b',size:1,strokeColor:'#1565c0',fillColor:'#1565c0',label:{offset:[-18,0]}});
board.create('point',JC,{fixed:true,highlight:false,name:'J_c',size:1,strokeColor:'#1565c0',fillColor:'#1565c0',label:{offset:[8,0]}});
var sl = {fixed:true,highlight:false,fontSize:15,anchorX:'middle',anchorY:'middle'};
board.create('text',[(Bx+Cx)/2,(By+Cy)/2-0.03*(ymax-ymin),la],sl);
board.create('text',[(Ax+Cx)/2-0.06*(xmax-xmin),(Ay+Cy)/2,lb],sl);
board.create('text',[(Ax+Bx)/2+0.04*(xmax-xmin),(Ay+By)/2,lc],sl);
[[/jsxgraph]]

<div>Radius of \(J_a\) (the excircle tangent to side \(BC={@sa@}\)): \(r_a = \) [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]] cm [[feedback:prt1]]</div>
<div>Radius of \(J_b\) (the excircle tangent to side \(CA={@sb@}\)): \(r_b = \) [[input:ans2]] [[validation:ans2]] cm [[feedback:prt2]]</div>
<div>Radius of \(J_c\) (the excircle tangent to side \(AB={@sc@}\)): \(r_c = \) [[input:ans3]] [[validation:ans3]] cm [[feedback:prt3]]</div>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
    <generalfeedback format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>Label the sides \(a={@sa@}\), \(b={@sb@}\), \(c={@sc@}\). The semi-perimeter is
\[ s = \frac{a+b+c}{2} = \frac{{@sa@}+{@sb@}+{@sc@}}{2} = {@ssemi@}, \]
and since the legs are \(a\) and \(b\) the area is
\[ \Delta = \tfrac12\, a\, b = \tfrac12\times{@sa@}\times{@sb@} = {@area@}. \]
The radius of the excircle tangent to a side equals the area divided by \(s\) minus that side:</p>
\[
\begin{align*}
r_a &= \frac{\Delta}{s-a} = \frac{{@area@}}{{@ssemi@}-{@sa@}} = {@ra@}\text{ cm}, \\[2pt]
r_b &= \frac{\Delta}{s-b} = \frac{{@area@}}{{@ssemi@}-{@sb@}} = {@rb@}\text{ cm}, \\[2pt]
r_c &= \frac{\Delta}{s-c} = \frac{{@area@}}{{@ssemi@}-{@sc@}} = {@rc@}\text{ cm}.
\end{align*}
\]
<p>(For contrast, the <em>inscribed</em> circle of this triangle has radius
\(r = \Delta/s = {@rin@}\) cm &mdash; smaller than every excircle, and inside the triangle.)</p>]]></text>
    </generalfeedback>
